# prefix-behavior — шаги записи (что показывается — prefix-behavior.md)
# Его слово 2026-10-06 к placement: «нужно добавить этап, где показывается, где меняется Prefix behavior
# и чем они различаются, возможно нужна отдельная gif». Отдельный GIF: место контрола в Fields, затем
# Strict, Insert only и Insert only без Field Prefix на простой строке и на строке списка. Подсветки нет.
title Prefix behavior | Does a Value change the start of the line?
open Prefix behavior.md
caret call the bank
stage Where it is
say Prefix behavior lives in each Field, under Behavior
settings Tags & PKM
spot Status
say This is the Status Field
pause 1600
spot Behavior
say Prefix behavior: Strict or Insert only
pause 2000
say #todo brings the checkbox [ ] as its Prefix
fill Prefix for #todo = [ ]
pause 1200
close

stage Strict
caret call the bank
say Strict: Status next on a plain line
cmd status-next
expect - [ ] #todo || call the bank
say Even a plain line gets the checkbox
pause 2200

stage Insert only
say Prefix behavior → Insert only
settings Tags & PKM
set Prefix behavior = Insert only
caret water the plants
say Insert only: Status next on a plain line
cmd status-next
expect #todo || water the plants
say A plain line stays plain
caret - fix the shelf
say Status next on a list line
cmd status-next
expect - [ ] #todo || fix the shelf
say A list line still gets the checkbox
pause 2200

stage Without Field Prefix
say Insert only: use Field Prefix → off
settings Tags & PKM
set Insert only: use Field Prefix = off
caret - read the brief
say Status next on a list line
cmd status-next
expect - #todo || read the brief
say The bullet stays, no checkbox
pause 2200
